WEBVTT

00:11:58.454 --> 00:12:02.912
a movie about trans women
who are black and poor,

00:12:03.162 --> 00:12:06.787
that they have just as much likelihood
of getting that movie made as

00:12:06.787 --> 00:12:11.121
the white dudes did. And then,
you know, best movie wins.

00:12:11.496 --> 00:12:15.746
The problem is not that we need all of
these movies to be super diverse and

00:12:15.746 --> 00:12:18.579
for all of these groups to be diverse
when they make them, though,

00:12:18.579 --> 00:12:23.162
that would be nice. The problem is, is
that for the entire history of Hollywood,

00:12:23.412 --> 00:12:27.246
we've had massive amounts of affirmative
action for one group, white,

00:12:27.287 --> 00:12:29.454
upper middle class, straight says men

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:32.829
and everybody else has to not
only make something good,